\p{The first process of this window, the base on Init, was disturbed (its round 1.715 s with a loader of 1.39 s; the other two rounds 0.643 and 0.656 s), so the base's Init cell and the geometric means of this table mean nothing; with the two undisturbed rounds the base's Init is 0.650 s and A is at -0.3 \%. Without Init the largest loss of A is +2.7 \% (con-leche) and of B +2.4 \% (reachability); no corpus is above the limit of 3 \%.}

